5
00:05:51,137 --> 00:05:52,937
Sanji versus Ramen Kenpo.

6
00:05:52,937 --> 00:06:12,897
Like I said, this guy is mine.

7
00:06:12,897 --> 00:06:13,857
You go on ahead.

8
