Those are sharp!

16
00:06:46,237 --> 00:06:51,737
Damn it!

17
00:06:51,737 --> 00:07:07,497
Let's head over on the roof.

18
00:07:07,497 --> 00:07:07,877
Right.

19
00:07:07,877 --> 00:07:10,917
We'll leave it to you then, Sanji.

20
00:07:10,917 --> 00:07:11,757
Best of luck!

21
00:07:11,757 --> 00:07:15,077
Go, go, go, go!

22
00:07:15,077 --> 00:07:17,477
