28
00:07:30,137 --> 00:07:33,137
If there's one thing that Nero loves to do, it's kill!

29
00:07:33,137 --> 00:07:34,637
Go, go, go, go!

30
00:07:34,637 --> 00:07:35,637
Ah!

31
