Pow!

34
00:07:46,137 --> 00:07:47,137
Huh?

35
00:08:00,137 --> 00:08:07,137
Oh, the wind carries my name from Sniper Island far away.

36
00:08:07,137 --> 00:08:11,137
When I take aim, it's straight and true.

37
00:08:11,137 --> 00:08:14,137
This would be a whole lot easier if we knew which car Robin was in.

38
00:08:14,137 --> 00:08:17,137
I could infiltrate from the roof and be done in a snap.

39
00:08:17,137 --> 00:08:21,137
Stop muttering and go already, you stupid slimy squid king!

40
00:08:21,137 --> 00:08:23,137
Who are you calling a slimy squid king?

41
00:08:23,137 --> 00:08:24,137
Uh-huh.

42
00:08:25,137 --> 00:08:26,137
Hmm.

43
00:08:27,137 --> 00:08:29,137
Slimy squid?

44
00:08:30,137 --> 00:08:31,137
Sticky octopus.

45
00:08:32,137 --> 00:08:34,137
Squid octopus, whatever, just hurry!

46
00:08:35,137 --> 00:08:36,137
Bikini guy!

47
00:08:37,137 --> 00:08:39,137
I've got a brilliant plan.

48
00:08:40,137 --> 00:08:42,137
Listen very carefully.

49
00:08:52,137 --> 00:08:55,137
This'll take forever if you keep dodging me like that.

50
00:08:55,137 --> 00:08:57,137
I told you, I'm in a hurry here.

51
00:08:59,137 --> 00:09:00,137
Okay then.

52
00:09:00,137 --> 00:09:01,137
Fine.

53
00:09:01,137 --> 00:09:03,137
Ramen Kenpo Noodle Slicer!

54
00:09:07,137 --> 00:09:08,137
Hehehehehe!

55
00:09:08,137 --> 00:09:10,137
Let's see how you like this!

56
00:09:10,137 --> 00:09:12,137
But escape late!

57
00:09:12,137 --> 00:09:13,137
T-T-T-T-T-T!

58
00:09:13,137 --> 00:09:26,137
Not only did you disrespect my beautiful attack, you kicked me 10 times, didn't you?

59
00:09:26,137 --> 00:09:31,937
Not only did you disrespect my beautiful attack, you kicked me ten times, didn't you?

60
00:09:32,817 --> 00:09:34,417
Actually, it was twelve times.

61
00:09:35,057 --> 00:09:38,717
Hey, you! Are you secretly super strong or something?

62
00:09:39,177 --> 00:09:41,917
It's not really a secret. Maybe you're just super weak.

63
00:09:42,457 --> 00:09:46,577
Super weak? Not even my old man would say something like that to me!

64
00:09:46,757 --> 00:09:50,457
How dare you! I'm Wansi! I wouldn't let you get away with this!

65
00:09:50,917 --> 00:09:54,597
Rude! Besides, I was simply distracted by your swirling eyebrows.

66
00:09:54,597 --> 00:09:57,377
They make me dizzy! That's why I fell for your attack.

67
00:09:57,497 --> 00:09:59,797
Still, you're a good fighter. Too bad you look weird.

68
00:09:59,937 --> 00:10:03,277
Hey, you freak! You're in no position to call anyone weird-looking!

69
00:10:07,017 --> 00:10:12,017
After that failed attack, I feel like I need to prove myself, so I'm gonna show you something amazing!

70
00:10:12,457 --> 00:10:14,957
This is why I was chosen to escort those criminals!

71
00:10:24,597 --> 00:10:31,037
Ramen Kenpo's Secret Technique! Ramen Kenpo's Secret Technique!

72
00:10:31,177 --> 00:10:34,737
Beat the dough! Pull the dough! Beat the dough! Pull the dough!

73
00:10:35,877 --> 00:10:38,237
Uh, what the hell is all that?

74
00:10:38,617 --> 00:10:41,017
It's my incredible edible combat uniform!

75
00:10:41,017 --> 00:10:50,057
Ramen's formal suit! Now, fight! Go, go, go, go!

76
00:10:50,757 --> 00:10:55,537
Go! The secret of this Ramen Kenpo Technique is controlling the three moving noodles at will!

77
00:10:55,937 --> 00:10:56,297
See?

78
00:10:56,437 --> 00:11:00,737
Bastard. How dare you disgrace food like that, you weirdo!

79
00:11:00,877 --> 00:11:07,837
My speed, my power, and my special abilities! I'm at a different level now in all those areas!

80
00:11:07,837 --> 00:11:13,077
Yeah! If showing you isn't enough, I'm gonna boot it in you!

81
00:11:13,517 --> 00:11:14,017
Go!

82
00:11:16,717 --> 00:11:19,317
Just shut up already and get on with it.

83
00:11:19,817 --> 00:11:24,077
But prepare yourself, because I'm gonna make you eat every last one of those noodles.

84
00:11:37,837 --> 00:11:51,057
Question.

85
00:11:51,657 --> 00:11:55,697
Who are you? What are you doing up here?

86
00:11:55,697 --> 00:12:03,457
The officer in charge of the third car, a four powers master, and a new recruit in CP9, the sea weasel, Nero.

87
00:12:04,537 --> 00:12:04,977
Yeah.

88
00:12:06,637 --> 00:12:10,437
Unfortunately, I'm under specific orders not to kill you.

89
00:12:11,157 --> 00:12:14,537
You know, you being one of our most important criminals and all.

90
00:12:15,297 --> 00:12:19,857
All right, that's one half. Now tell me what you're doing up here on the roof of this train.

91
00:12:20,177 --> 00:12:22,437
If you'd just waited inside, I would've come to you.

92
00:12:22,437 --> 00:12:27,757
Well, how was I supposed to know that? You may have tried to cheat and skip right past this car.

93
00:12:28,217 --> 00:12:31,997
My, my, my. That's rather cautious of you.

94
00:12:32,297 --> 00:12:35,397
But in your line of work, you always got to keep your guard up, right?

95
00:12:36,377 --> 00:12:39,377
