101
00:13:20,957 --> 00:13:25,177
Beats me? Come on, you know that, idiot. What if he fell into the water or something?

102
00:13:25,177 --> 00:13:28,277
Oh, slippery.

103
00:13:28,817 --> 00:13:33,217
That's impossible. I mean, he was right here up until a few seconds ago. Right, Chopper?

104
00:13:33,337 --> 00:13:37,257
What? Oh, sure. This is Luffy we're talking about. That doesn't mean anything.

105
00:13:37,637 --> 00:13:40,337
