106
00:13:40,557 --> 00:13:44,237
Maybe he's stuck in Rocket Man's chimney. It happens, right, Zoro?

107
00:13:44,577 --> 00:13:47,237
Oh, sure. And choking you happens, too.

108
00:13:47,237 --> 00:14:00,637
