129
00:15:40,137 --> 00:15:42,137
What? You're gonna pay for that!

130
00:15:42,137 --> 00:15:42,637
You're gonna pay for that!

131
00:15:48,137 --> 00:15:49,137
Go, go, go!

132
00:15:51,137 --> 00:15:52,137
Ah, damn it!

133
00:15:52,137 --> 00:15:55,137
